WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.380
You're on a job.

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:02.300
A lead calls.

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:03.440
Nobody answers.

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:06.230
ZeroHand texts them back

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:08.190
and follows up on open estimates,

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:10.830
helping more leads become booked jobs.

00:00:11.925 --> 00:00:13.485
You approve the messages.

00:00:14.245 --> 00:00:15.485
Emergencies and complaints

00:00:15.505 --> 00:00:16.465
go to a person.

00:00:16.945 --> 00:00:18.165
You can see what was said.

00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:20.530
Already using AI?

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:21.850
We test what it says

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:22.810
against your rules.

00:00:24.025 --> 00:00:25.125
Grow the shop.

00:00:25.665 --> 00:00:26.505
Not the back office.

00:00:26.865 --> 00:00:27.785
ZeroHand Labs.
